\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overview of DADS. (a) Shift $\Delta $ is combined with CTC sensitivity $G=\partial \ell /\partial E_a$ from the frozen adapted head. Averaging absolute elementwise products over valid training frames gives a global top-$K$ native-coordinate mask. (b) Selected coordinates keep adapted values; others restore reference values. The same frozen head decodes without retraining. Labels and gradients are calibration-only; feature strips schematically show corresponding coordinates.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:overview}{{1}{2}{Overview of DADS. (a) Shift $\Delta $ is combined with CTC sensitivity $G=\partial \ell /\partial E_a$ from the frozen adapted head. Averaging absolute elementwise products over valid training frames gives a global top-$K$ native-coordinate mask. (b) Selected coordinates keep adapted values; others restore reference values. The same frozen head decodes without retraining. Labels and gradients are calibration-only; feature strips schematically show corresponding coordinates}{figure.1}{}}
